WEBVTT

00:00:02.503 --> 00:00:03.921
Can I enter, senpai?

00:00:04.421 --> 00:00:07.216
Why did Himeragi Yukina came here?

00:00:07.257 --> 00:00:09.510
How would I know!? Okay, hide!

00:00:11.929 --> 00:00:13.597
I'm entering, senpai.

00:00:13.722 --> 00:00:17.100
H-Hey, Himeragi! What do you want?

00:00:17.226 --> 00:00:20.771
Forget that. What's with your hair?

00:00:21.104 --> 00:00:21.722
Hair?

00:00:23.815 --> 00:00:25.317
What is this?!

00:01:58.619 --> 00:02:03.248
That's right, I have used up all of my energy...

00:02:05.375 --> 00:02:09.463
Avrora!
Avrora, where are you?
Avrora Florestina!

00:02:14.218 --> 00:02:18.722
Is that you, Avrora? How
did you end up like this?

00:02:26.230 --> 00:02:28.649
That little guy doesn't look like me.

00:02:28.941 --> 00:02:33.028
T-That's right. It doesn't make sense, since he's male.

00:02:37.157 --> 00:02:42.287
I have brought this pure liquid from the
lake. Quench your thirst with it.

00:02:42.538 --> 00:02:45.999
Thank you, but this is from this store.

00:02:46.166 --> 00:02:51.129
Don't hold back, Mimori has entrusted
this to me. I'll pay for it.

00:02:54.967 --> 00:02:58.846
Akatsuki Mimori... Akatsuki Kojou's mother.

00:03:02.266 --> 00:03:05.644
Wow. As expected of the Sword Shaman
of the Lion King Organization.

00:03:05.894 --> 00:03:09.273
Who are you?! Why did you involve
us in this?!

00:03:10.649 --> 00:03:15.153
I'm Akatsuki Mimori. Or in other words,
the mother of Akatsuki Kojou.

00:03:15.571 --> 00:03:16.947
Kojou-kun's?!

00:03:17.281 --> 00:03:20.075
So, you are Akatsuki Gajou's wife?!

00:03:20.951 --> 00:03:24.496
Indeed. Therefore, I would like to
ask you a favor.

00:03:30.836 --> 00:03:36.341
In order to meet Akatsuki Kojou, we need to leave
the area controlled by the Second Primogenitor.

00:03:37.426 --> 00:03:38.260
Can you walk?

00:03:38.594 --> 00:03:43.390
S-Sure. But I'm worried about the
Sword Priestess and the dragon girl.

00:03:44.016 --> 00:03:48.353
To save them, we need enough power to
oppose the Second Primogenitor.

00:03:49.062 --> 00:03:54.026
To save Yuiri and the others, I'm going to
take you to Akatsuki Kojou.

00:03:54.443 --> 00:03:55.068
Kojou...

00:03:58.864 --> 00:04:01.575
I-I've already offered up enough for it.

00:04:05.829 --> 00:04:12.336
I'm also hungry. You can eat what
you want. I'll pay for what is missing.

00:04:15.881 --> 00:04:17.257
How did it end up like this?

00:04:17.633 --> 00:04:19.510
It happened because of you losing control.

00:04:20.961 --> 00:04:29.603
Did you really think you could fool me as your observer?
You have been suffering as a vampire since you lost control on East Island.

00:04:30.527 --> 00:04:31.727
That's...

00:04:31.851 --> 00:04:33.416
Senpai, if you want me to
give you blood..

00:04:33.440 --> 00:04:36.235
No, Himeragi! I'll not suck your blood.

00:04:36.735 --> 00:04:43.158
Why? Do you want to s-s-s-suck someone else's blood?

00:04:43.450 --> 00:04:51.375
It's not that. If I drank your blood,
I wouldn't be able to contain myself
and go all the way.

00:04:53.110 --> 00:04:55.571
All the way?

00:04:58.590 --> 00:05:01.760
Take responsibility in that case.

00:05:02.928 --> 00:05:03.804
Himeragi!

00:05:11.019 --> 00:05:14.999
This, Himeragi...There's no one there!

00:05:15.023 --> 00:05:17.275
Move away, Akatsuki-senpai.

00:05:20.028 --> 00:05:24.199
K-Kazugaya-san...What are you doing here?

00:05:24.283 --> 00:05:27.244
I-It's not what you think, Himeragi! Don't misunderstand!

00:05:27.286 --> 00:05:31.748
That's right, I'm not thinking of getting ahead or anything!

00:05:35.711 --> 00:05:37.337
Kano-chan...

00:05:37.379 --> 00:05:41.049
Sorry, Onii-san, you asked me to hide, but...

00:05:41.091 --> 00:05:42.050
Senpai...

00:05:42.092 --> 00:05:44.094
Akatsuki Kojou...

00:05:44.303 --> 00:05:45.762
Gimme a break.

00:05:48.932 --> 00:05:53.437
The store is destroyed, but the alarm
wasn't raised. How weird.

00:05:53.687 --> 00:06:01.570
Come to think of it, the top brass of M.A.R have been controlling
everything lately. What do they gain of this as a company?

00:06:05.657 --> 00:06:06.658
Avrora!

00:06:09.450 --> 00:06:13.804
Magic power is going out of control.
Did something happened to Akatsuki Kojou?!

00:06:15.584 --> 00:06:17.085
K-Kojou...

00:06:17.377 --> 00:06:18.337
Senpai!

00:06:18.420 --> 00:06:19.213
Onii-san!

00:06:25.928 --> 00:06:27.387
It's useless.

00:06:29.806 --> 00:06:31.308
Run!

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:39.360
Don't worry, we will always be on your side.

00:06:49.493 --> 00:06:53.830
It's possible the Second Primogenitor have noticed
what just happened. We have to leave quickly!

00:06:55.666 --> 00:06:56.375
This way!

00:06:58.961 --> 00:06:59.920
Arenaru...

00:07:00.045 --> 00:07:03.423
We did not make it in time. We
have to evade it some way...

00:07:06.009 --> 00:07:07.177
The little thing...

00:07:08.220 --> 00:07:08.929
Avrora!

00:07:12.590 --> 00:07:15.736
I, War Dancer of the High God, as
a dancer of the Lion, beseech thee...

00:07:15.853 --> 00:07:17.479
Light, come forth!

00:07:19.731 --> 00:07:20.899
Shio...

00:07:21.567 --> 00:07:22.442
Did that do it?

00:07:26.405 --> 00:07:28.490
I guess I can't do it with my current
strength.

00:07:28.574 --> 00:07:29.157
Shio...

00:07:29.366 --> 00:07:31.368
Run, even if it is just you!

00:07:31.451 --> 00:07:32.327
I will not accept it!

00:07:32.411 --> 00:07:33.245
But...

00:07:34.560 --> 00:07:36.145
Don't move, you two!

00:07:38.792 --> 00:07:40.544
Over here, Avrora!

00:07:43.547 --> 00:07:45.382
Our voices...?

00:07:50.304 --> 00:07:53.223
Good grief, I managed to fool them.

00:07:54.600 --> 00:07:56.935
Y-you, why are you here?

00:07:57.227 --> 00:08:01.106
I'm happy that you remembered me, Avrora-chan.

00:08:02.274 --> 00:08:07.070
I'm the Manmade Island Management Corporation's
Yaze Motoki. I came to help you, Hikawa Shio.

00:08:12.327 --> 00:08:13.827
What is this softness?

00:08:19.041 --> 00:08:24.171
I see! Those three stopped my vampire urges.

00:08:25.088 --> 00:08:26.757
Senpai...

00:08:28.258 --> 00:08:28.842
Damn!

00:08:49.488 --> 00:08:51.532
Even after sucking that much blood,
it's still not enough?

00:08:53.617 --> 00:08:56.870
Come out. Don't annoy me right now.

00:08:58.413 --> 00:09:00.582
Do you want to die, asshole?!

00:09:04.503 --> 00:09:08.757
How scary. You don't beat around
the bush, kid.

00:09:09.383 --> 00:09:13.053
You are the First Primogenitor,
Ki Juranbarada.

00:09:13.345 --> 00:09:18.475
What, you already know?
I wanted to suprise you.

00:09:19.017 --> 00:09:20.519
Why are you here?

00:09:20.894 --> 00:09:23.814
Don't get defensive. I came to give you
some advice.

00:09:24.731 --> 00:09:29.862
As it is, it will occur once again.
What did they call it?

00:09:30.195 --> 00:09:32.614
Yes, Scorched Banquet.

00:09:34.157 --> 00:09:35.534
Scorched Banquet?!

00:09:40.038 --> 00:09:45.794
There's a similiar food to this one in my country.

00:09:46.503 --> 00:09:49.840
We call it "Kari".

00:09:49.965 --> 00:09:52.801
I-I see. I get it.

00:09:53.510 --> 00:09:55.179
Eat it before it gets cold.

00:09:55.429 --> 00:09:56.305
Y-Yes.

00:09:57.764 --> 00:09:59.474
Can I have a question?

00:09:59.474 --> 00:10:00.642
What is it?

00:10:01.185 --> 00:10:07.691
Well...We heard that you, Foregazer are male.

00:10:08.650 --> 00:10:15.949
Male or female? Is it really necessary to
mull over such a little detail?

00:10:17.451 --> 00:10:22.623
The moon is the moon, and a flower is a
flower. Each one is beautiful in its own way.

00:10:22.664 --> 00:10:24.416
And that's fine, not?

00:10:25.625 --> 00:10:30.255
It's foolish to not accept what is right.

00:10:30.500 --> 00:10:31.376
T-that's true...

00:10:32.132 --> 00:10:38.180
Therefore, something that is not beautiful in my vicinity, is not necessary.

00:10:38.847 --> 00:10:43.143
That includes some despicable races.

00:10:43.810 --> 00:10:47.689
Those include those that are
nothing, but stinky beasts.

00:10:49.107 --> 00:10:54.696
But I expect a little more from the Fourth Primogenitor.

00:10:55.239 --> 00:11:00.577
You have been bitten by the
Fourth Primogenitor, right?

00:11:00.619 --> 00:11:02.371
That's...

00:11:03.121 --> 00:11:06.959
I'm not criticizing your tastes.

00:11:07.334 --> 00:11:11.338
You are lucky, you made it
in time for the banquet.

00:11:11.588 --> 00:11:12.297
Banquet?

00:11:14.716 --> 00:11:17.094
The Scorched Banquet.

00:11:19.263 --> 00:11:20.514
Why will the banquet occur?

00:11:20.973 --> 00:11:26.520
You will cause it. To be precise, your familiars.

00:11:26.854 --> 00:11:32.901
My familiars? But thanks to my efforts to tame them, they should be under my control.

00:11:34.486 --> 00:11:39.491
What a bad joke. Even I haven't been able to do that.

00:11:40.784 --> 00:11:51.503
The familiars are not the property, weapons or pets of the vampires.
They are merely hungry beasts that live within us.

00:11:51.837 --> 00:11:56.133
When they run out of prey, they will go
looking for it on their own.

00:11:56.800 --> 00:11:57.342
Prey?

00:11:57.759 --> 00:12:05.434
Magic. It is said that the Fourth Primogenitor will be the strongest once you control all 12 of them.

00:12:06.476 --> 00:12:17.404
That's one thing you are missing. Not to mention me, that bastard
Foregazer, and the old witch, Chaos Bride is here.

00:12:18.280 --> 00:12:23.702
Your familiars realized that you are in
trouble in your incomplete form.

00:12:24.328 --> 00:12:28.957
That's why they are seeking magic power
in place of the twelfth familar?

00:12:29.291 --> 00:12:32.169
It would be good if it was
just magic power.

00:12:33.754 --> 00:12:35.047
Memories.

00:12:35.506 --> 00:12:36.173
Memories?

00:12:36.548 --> 00:12:43.180
The familiars' appetite wouldn't be solved even if they devoured the magical power of all the residents of the island.

00:12:44.014 --> 00:12:49.770
That's why in place of the magical power, they will devour the strong emotions instead.

00:12:50.270 --> 00:12:56.485
The Fourth Primogenitor will take all of those memories and generate an Outbreak.

00:12:57.152 --> 00:13:00.739
That's the Scorched Banquet's real form.

00:13:00.864 --> 00:13:03.992
It can't be. Is there no way to stop it?!

00:13:05.577 --> 00:13:06.203
There is.

00:13:07.496 --> 00:13:12.000
In the first place, why are your familiars seeking magic power?

00:13:12.668 --> 00:13:15.754
That's to replace the one that is needed.

00:13:17.172 --> 00:13:27.057
You realized? That's right, if you consume Dodekatos
and get back the twelfth familiar, the banquet will end.

00:13:28.767 --> 00:13:36.984
Or you can take everyone's memories on this island
and obtain that power. It's your choice.

00:13:38.902 --> 00:13:39.778
I am...

00:13:40.362 --> 00:13:45.659
I just came to tell you that, we will
have fun another day. See you.

00:13:45.784 --> 00:13:46.493
Wait!

00:14:07.097 --> 00:14:07.764
Himeragi...

00:14:08.974 --> 00:14:11.059
Yukina went out on a mission.

00:14:11.685 --> 00:14:13.687
Nyanko-sensei...What mission?

00:14:14.062 --> 00:14:16.940
I asked her to recover Avrora Florestina.

00:14:17.566 --> 00:14:18.192
You...

00:14:18.775 --> 00:14:24.114
Paper Noise. One of the Three Saints, Shizuka Koyomi-sama.

00:14:24.740 --> 00:14:27.659
Did you get that injury from Order the End?

00:14:28.368 --> 00:14:33.957
It was my mistake for having entered enemy territory. However, don't worry about me.

00:14:35.042 --> 00:14:40.672
You said Himeragi is going to bring
back Avrova, but she should be at M.A.R.

00:14:41.173 --> 00:14:48.472
Right now, she's with Hikawa Shio escaping from Itogami Island's
East Island, controlled by the Second Primogenitor.

00:14:49.348 --> 00:14:53.936
Since it might be difficult for them
to escape, I sent Yukina.

00:14:54.269 --> 00:14:55.854
Huh? Why did that-

00:14:55.938 --> 00:14:57.356
I will explain now.

00:14:58.106 --> 00:15:00.651
But I want to tell you something first.

00:15:01.777 --> 00:15:10.285
Don't forget that I gave the order to Yukina, that's why I ask you to understand her.

00:15:10.827 --> 00:15:12.204
Y-Yes...

00:15:19.044 --> 00:15:25.425
I couldn't believe that my mother let out Avrora.
As M.A.R's employee, what is she doing?

00:15:25.884 --> 00:15:29.638
Onii-san. Have you seen Shizuri-san?

00:15:29.680 --> 00:15:31.765
No. What happened?

00:15:31.807 --> 00:15:38.605
She disappeared. I know she left for Keystone Gate
this morning, but I don't know what happened after that.

00:15:39.235 --> 00:15:40.135
Keystone Gate?

00:15:40.941 --> 00:15:50.284
She said she must end the war before the banquet has
happened. It worried me.

00:15:50.325 --> 00:15:52.452
How does she know about the banquet?

00:15:54.705 --> 00:15:56.290
No way, she heard us last night?

00:15:58.250 --> 00:16:01.587
I must stop Kasuko, or she will try to
defeat The Blood on her own!

00:16:06.091 --> 00:16:09.887
Damn! Why is Himeragi and Kasuko
doing it on their own?!

00:16:15.684 --> 00:16:17.394
Kirasaka?!

00:16:19.062 --> 00:16:21.523
Damn, what's going on?!

00:16:28.864 --> 00:16:33.994
Thank you. Rui-san, Yuno-san.
I am really thankful for your help.

00:16:34.203 --> 00:16:39.041
I never thought Order The End
will use prohibited weapons.

00:16:39.166 --> 00:16:46.423
I wouldn't be so sure. These things are M.A.R's
new products, which are not public yet.

00:16:47.549 --> 00:16:52.721
In short, there's a high chance M.A.R is protecting Keystone Gate.

00:16:53.180 --> 00:16:58.393
Their relationship with this war
is suspicious.

00:16:59.228 --> 00:17:02.481
No way, it was M.A.R who sent
Order The End?

00:17:07.444 --> 00:17:11.990
I never heard of get stuck on
a parachute two days in a row.

00:17:12.115 --> 00:17:13.534
Kirasaka, are you okay?!

00:17:13.575 --> 00:17:16.787
Akatsuki Kojou? It's good, please help me!

00:17:17.621 --> 00:17:19.581
No, don't come yet!

00:17:20.624 --> 00:17:21.875
Don't look at me!

00:17:26.421 --> 00:17:28.215
You helped my parents escape?

00:17:28.924 --> 00:17:35.514
That's right. Your mother was captured by M.A.R,
so your father, Akatsuki Gajou went to help her.

00:17:35.514 --> 00:17:41.436
I had nothing to do with it, but got pulled into it.
So in the end, we stole M.A.R's plane, and-

00:17:41.436 --> 00:17:45.399
That's right! What happened to the
plane I sat on?

00:17:45.399 --> 00:17:51.488
Somehow it managed to land. In other
words, my parents were on that?

00:17:51.530 --> 00:17:57.077
I hope they are right. But they seem like
the type of people who won't die easily.

00:17:58.704 --> 00:18:01.415
Where is Yukina? Is she not with you?

00:18:01.415 --> 00:18:06.086
She's going to help Shio and the
others and to get back Avrora.

00:18:06.461 --> 00:18:08.463
Huh?! Why didn't you stop her?

00:18:08.505 --> 00:18:12.176
Stop it? Nyanko-sensei and the
other one let Himeragi go.

00:18:12.342 --> 00:18:18.724
That's the problem! They are making
Yukina kill Avrora Florestina!

00:18:18.932 --> 00:18:20.684
To kill her?

00:18:21.935 --> 00:18:24.062
No way, to stop the Scorched Banquet?

00:18:24.146 --> 00:18:31.528
Yes. Your mother said that's the
simplest way. But there's another way.

00:18:32.628 --> 00:18:38.761
Anyways, we need to stop Yukina! She's going to end
up with misfortune. That's one thing I want to avoid.

00:18:38.785 --> 00:18:42.789
If that happens, I would prefer she
would depend on you.

00:18:42.831 --> 00:18:44.958
Depend on me? What do you mean?

00:18:46.835 --> 00:18:48.045
Keystone Gate...!

00:18:50.464 --> 00:18:53.091
Are these also one of M.A.R's weapons?

00:18:58.972 --> 00:19:00.807
Akatsuki Kojou!

00:19:00.807 --> 00:19:02.851
Himeragi... Kasuko...

00:19:03.951 --> 00:19:06.912
Damn. I am...

00:19:09.608 --> 00:19:14.446
I'm sorry, Hikawa-senpai.
Give me Avrora-san.

00:19:14.746 --> 00:19:15.997
Himeragi Yukina?

00:19:16.839 --> 00:19:20.218
What's the matter, Himeragi-chan? Are you alone? Where's Kojou?

00:19:20.577 --> 00:19:30.254
Avrora-san, no, 12th Kaleid Blood, come
with me if you want to save Akatsuki Kojou.

00:19:30.671 --> 00:19:34.716
What does she mean? Is she
being controlled by someone?

00:19:34.842 --> 00:19:39.221
Impossible. She was sent here by one of the Three Saints, Shizuka Koyomi.

00:19:39.471 --> 00:19:41.223
Shizuka-sama's order?

00:19:41.598 --> 00:19:44.768
No. I came of my own free will.

00:19:45.352 --> 00:19:47.688
Explain, Himeragi Yukina.

00:19:47.688 --> 00:19:52.276
We will have tons of time after this.
So for now, please step aside.

00:19:54.486 --> 00:19:55.153
No!

00:19:56.321 --> 00:19:58.907
Yaze Motoki. Take Avrora and run!

00:19:59.700 --> 00:20:00.701
Spirit Summoning!

00:20:01.535 --> 00:20:02.870
Sekkarou!

00:20:05.706 --> 00:20:07.457
Shinsha!
Young Lightning!

00:20:09.585 --> 00:20:12.921
It can't be...such an unreasonable way of fighting...

00:20:13.672 --> 00:20:18.594
I'm sorry, but I couldn't beat you
any other way, Hikawa-senpai.

00:20:19.469 --> 00:20:22.181
Oh boy, what a problem...

00:20:22.764 --> 00:20:23.849
Yaze-senpai...

00:20:25.809 --> 00:20:30.814
My power cannot be blocked with your spear. What will you do?

00:20:34.234 --> 00:20:36.028
Hey, Avro-chan!

00:20:36.069 --> 00:20:50.709
H-Himeragi Yukina. If you came here to protect Kojou, I will allow it. Use your spear and let my soul leave the world.

00:20:51.960 --> 00:20:53.128
Don't do it, Avro-chan!

00:20:53.629 --> 00:20:55.714
Himeragi, stop it!

00:21:02.554 --> 00:21:03.764
Why?

00:21:05.557 --> 00:21:12.898
If I don't destroy you, Akatsuki-senpai will suffer alone once again.

00:21:14.441 --> 00:21:20.405
Don't worry, Sword Priestess,
my body was already destroyed once.

00:21:31.708 --> 00:21:33.669
Why are you getting in the way, Yukki?!

00:21:34.127 --> 00:21:35.921
Yuiri, why?!

00:21:35.921 --> 00:21:42.803
I'm sorry, Shio-chan. Don't get in the way, Yukki. Otherwise, the island will be destroyed by the Outbreak.

00:21:43.503 --> 00:21:45.772
Destroyed? What do you mean?

00:21:45.806 --> 00:21:50.686
I understand! The Scorched Banquet! That's
why Himeragi is trying to kill her!

00:21:50.727 --> 00:21:54.940
Stand aside, Yukki! Do you want to
make Kojou-kun kill her?

00:21:55.882 --> 00:21:57.234
That's...

00:21:57.276 --> 00:21:58.277
Kazumi!

00:22:03.673 --> 00:22:04.324
Himeragi!

00:22:04.366 --> 00:22:05.826
Damn!

00:22:09.413 --> 00:22:11.373
I'm sorry, Avrora-chan.

00:22:19.715 --> 00:22:20.507
Yuiri-san!

00:22:20.549 --> 00:22:21.717
Yuiri!

00:22:27.556 --> 00:22:32.311
I'm sorry, but I can't let you hurt her.

00:22:34.229 --> 00:22:35.731
The Blood...

00:22:37.024 --> 00:22:40.986
I came to pick you up, Nee-sama.
